    "main": {
      "type": "main-about-1-page",
      "blocks": {
        "d4bab6c1-ab4b-442b-8884-47890038f054": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About Us",
            "content": "At <b>Puriteo</b>, we believe in the power of purity. Our journey began with a mission to create safe, effective, and high-quality products that support health and beauty naturally. Every product we craft is infused with scientifically backed ingredients, ensuring maximum benefits without harmful additives. We are committed to <b>transparency, quality, and customer well-being.</b> With a team of experts in health and skincare, we strive to bring you innovative solutions that enhance your daily routine. Trust Puriteo for products that put your health first.\n\n<br><br>\n\nAt Puriteo, we don’t just create products—we create <b>solutions that empower your health and beauty.</b> Rooted in science and inspired by nature, our carefully crafted formulations bring together the best of both worlds, ensuring that what you put on and in your body is <b>safe, effective, and of the highest quality.</b> From <b>nourishing skincare</b> that breathes life into your complexion to <b>powerful health supplements</b> designed for overall well-being, every Puriteo product is made with <b>integrity, backed by research, and free from harmful additives.</b> \n\n<br><br>\n\nBecause when it comes to your health, <b>nothing but the purest will do.</b> Explore <b>Puriteo</b>—where <b>wellness is redefined, one product at a time.</b>",
            "content_max_width": 1450,
            "align": "left",
            "content_text_color": "#232323"
          }
        }
      },
